WEBVTT

00:02:29.083 --> 00:02:31.184
That's how it works.
I don't make the rules.

00:02:31.208 --> 00:02:32.351
(Laughter)

00:02:32.375 --> 00:02:36.643
She's had some drinks,
so I drive us in her parents' car,

00:02:36.667 --> 00:02:38.958
and we get pulled over by the police.

00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:41.309
I'm scared.

00:02:41.333 --> 00:02:44.809
I turn on the flashing lights
to indicate compliance.

00:02:44.833 --> 00:02:46.226
I pull over slowly

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.893
under the brightest streetlight I can find

00:02:48.917 --> 00:02:51.875
in case I need witnesses
or dashcam footage.

00:02:53.417 --> 00:02:56.476
We get out my identification,
the car registration,

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.684
lay it out in the open,
roll down the windows,

00:02:58.708 --> 00:03:01.018
my hands are placed on the steering wheel,